<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Santa Fe Intl begun as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Santa Fe Intl begun as buy.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>CS First Boston said on Thursday it started coverage of Santa Fe International Corp with a buy rating.  </p>
<p>-- Analyst Ken Sill said he believed the company was well-managed, had a good fleet and was well-positioned to benefit from rising international day rates.</p>
<p>-- The stock was unchanged at 41.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
